## Coinbase MCP readiness

Execution is unavailable in this preview. No test has been started, and there is no submission endpoint.

Techtree catalog: <%= @catalog["suite_id"] %>, version <%= @catalog["suite_version"] %>.
Target: <%= @catalog["target"] %>.

This is a diagnostic, not a grade. The visiting agent reports what happened. Techtree checks the report's shape and consistency, not whether Coinbase calls happened. Compatibility is not independently verified.

Scope: portfolios, a discovered spot product, and futures availability. A successful product read does not establish trading eligibility.

Limits: <%= @catalog["call_budget"]["discovery_requests"] %> discovery request; at most <%= @catalog["call_budget"]["coinbase_read_calls"] %> read calls; no automatic retries or pagination. No orders, transfers, payments or Points earning.

